WEBVTT

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:31.720
<i>Suteta hazu no fuan no tane ga 
kokoro tsukiyabutte me o dashita</i>

00:00:33.910 --> 00:00:47.950
<i>Musuu no ibara ga kyou mo 
ashimoto nobite machikamaeteiru</i>

00:00:47.950 --> 00:00:56.410
<i>Doko e yukeba aeru</i>

00:00:56.410 --> 00:01:11.300
<i>Dakishimenaide senaka no toge 
wa kimi o kizutsukeru yo</i>

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:26.530
<i>Soredemo afureru omoi ga kimi o sagashiteiru</i>

00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:37.450
Welcome back, my sister.

00:01:37.890 --> 00:01:38.910
What?

00:01:45.160 --> 00:01:48.870
"Departure"

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:48.870
Please... say a pure prayer...

00:01:48.870 --> 00:01:51.940
Please... bestow immaculate life upon us...

00:01:51.940 --> 00:01:54.130
The update has resumed!

00:01:52.470 --> 00:01:56.010
Please... say a pure prayer...

00:01:56.010 --> 00:01:59.270
Please... bestow immaculate life upon us...

00:01:56.010 --> 00:01:59.270
Change of plans! Kidnap that priestess!

00:01:59.720 --> 00:02:01.760
May our departed souls enter heaven.

00:01:59.720 --> 00:02:01.760
She is, indeed...

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:03.470
May the blessing of heaven be upon us.

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:03.470
The key to the world!

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:06.180
May our departed souls enter heaven.

00:02:04.980 --> 00:02:07.060
Don't let them!

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:08.770
May the blessing of heaven be upon us.

00:02:08.770 --> 00:02:13.020
So long as the sky does not fall upon us...

00:02:09.620 --> 00:02:13.020
Nessa! Let's get out of here for now, Nessa.

00:02:13.020 --> 00:02:13.980
Phryne...

00:02:13.980 --> 00:02:16.180
So long as the ocean does 
not split and run wild...

00:02:16.180 --> 00:02:19.070
May eternal happiness be upon us.

00:02:35.370 --> 00:02:38.240
Wha... What the hell...?!

00:02:38.970 --> 00:02:41.550
Th-They're dead! This can't be...

00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:47.180
Someone... Please help my son!

00:02:50.880 --> 00:02:52.610
Lie down and stay put!

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:56.430
All right, Nessa. Let's go to Phryne!

00:02:56.430 --> 00:02:57.320
What?

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:00.560
Sister...

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:04.360
Please come this way.

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:08.150
Phryne!

00:03:15.410 --> 00:03:17.850
Why?! Why are you here...?!

00:03:17.850 --> 00:03:18.670
That's...!

00:03:28.420 --> 00:03:29.810
What're you doing, you naughty boy!

00:03:30.150 --> 00:03:31.250
What?

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:32.900
We're withdrawing!

00:03:44.480 --> 00:03:46.790
So this is what it's like to 
hold the world in your hands?

00:03:46.790 --> 00:03:48.870
She didn't look like she'd be this heavy.

00:03:52.520 --> 00:03:54.370
Move it! Move it!

00:03:59.340 --> 00:04:00.920
Go already!

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:02.300
Hold it!

00:04:14.260 --> 00:04:15.730
Don't let them get away!

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:16.900
Priestess... Priestess...

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:19.320
Please help us, Priestess... Help us...

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:20.530
Let go of me.

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:24.120
I have to go report this 
to the Archpriestess!

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:34.460
Switch to manual piloting.

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:37.040
Otherwise the temple will 
find out where we're headed.

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:37.990
Roger.

00:04:47.970 --> 00:04:52.720
Idiot... Idiot... You tubby...

00:04:53.720 --> 00:04:55.840
If your belly wasn't so big,

00:04:55.840 --> 00:04:58.940
you could've run faster and escaped...

00:04:58.940 --> 00:05:02.110
You tubby... idiot...!

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:12.870
<i>I've never seen... a dead person.</i>

00:05:13.690 --> 00:05:17.830
<i>He looks... he looks like some 
transparent kind of plastic...</i>

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:20.210
<i>Up until just earlier...</i>

00:05:23.130 --> 00:05:27.140
<i>These guys are, after all... murderers.</i>

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:39.190
Phryne!

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:49.280
Ah... Er... Long time no see, huh?

00:05:54.830 --> 00:05:56.870
Oh right, we'll greet each other later.

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:01.380
Let's escape from here together, Phryne.

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:02.460
What?

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:05.170
The guys here are definitely bad news!

00:06:05.170 --> 00:06:06.450
Let's escape together.

00:06:06.450 --> 00:06:07.970
Then, I'll return Nessa to you.

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:11.990
Argh! They made this knot tight!

00:06:11.990 --> 00:06:13.470
You'll return Nessa?

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:17.720
Yeah. You were Phryne's to start with.

00:06:23.070 --> 00:06:24.550
Okay, Phryne.

00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:29.410
How dare you!

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:31.160
What?

00:06:31.890 --> 00:06:34.800
Why did you awaken Nessa?

00:06:34.800 --> 00:06:39.040
Well... because you left without 
saying anything, right?

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:42.080
I wanted to find a clue in 
the data you left and...

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:43.970
You researched it without permission?!

00:06:43.970 --> 00:06:46.210
What a despicable character you are!

00:06:46.210 --> 00:06:48.090
What?! What do you mean by that?!

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:51.830
If you'd be so upset about me finding 
it out, why did you leave it with me?

00:06:52.390 --> 00:06:55.600
Don't hit Clain!

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:56.770
N-Nessa...

00:06:57.220 --> 00:07:00.640
Don't hit him! Nessa dislikes hitting!

00:07:00.640 --> 00:07:02.310
Nessa likes liking!

00:07:04.320 --> 00:07:07.940
Oops, sorry. Having long legs is a problem.

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:09.490
Sunda!

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:12.700
Sorry to interrupt your attempt 
to let the princess go free.

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:15.020
But I need to talk to her, so...

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:18.080
I'll escort the princess.

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:22.790
I can walk by myself.

00:07:28.550 --> 00:07:29.470
Nessa...

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:32.800
Nessa likes liking...

00:07:33.940 --> 00:07:36.180
but Nessa dislikes that woman.

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:39.640
The daughter of the Archpriestess...

00:07:39.640 --> 00:07:41.200
No, the key to the world...

00:07:41.890 --> 00:07:44.320
Why did you run away from the temple?

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:49.990
Also, that doppel that you took 
out from the temple with you...

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:52.240
She's...

00:07:55.410 --> 00:07:59.540
Either way, it'd be better to just 
let the Fractale System fall apart.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:01.710
I agree.

00:08:01.710 --> 00:08:04.920
Oh? So we both have the same opinion, huh?

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:08.960
Then... you have the option of 
becoming a member of our group.

00:08:10.320 --> 00:08:13.430
Well, you can take your 
time thinking about it.

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:17.180
The world will come to an end while 
you're enjoying your captivity.

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:19.140
Isn't that right?

00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:26.800
Don't cry!

00:08:26.800 --> 00:08:30.980
Everyone will die at some 
point and return to the soil.

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:34.780
It's the death of a hero 
who stood against Fractale!

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:40.200
So, don't cry.

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:47.000
O-Okay. I won't cry anymore.

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:50.150
Good girl. You're a soldier, too.

00:08:52.380 --> 00:08:55.470
Hero? Soldier? Don't make me laugh.

00:08:55.860 --> 00:08:58.050
They're just terrorists.

00:08:58.930 --> 00:09:00.820
Acting so cool... What's up with that?

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:08.610
♪ If I am to offer... ♪

00:09:07.100 --> 00:09:07.850
What?

00:09:08.610 --> 00:09:14.490
♪ ...a wish to the day star... ♪

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:19.030
♪ In exchange for... ♪

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:19.870
Stop it, Nessa. ♪

00:09:19.030 --> 00:09:21.120
♪ ...accepting the continuing pain... ♪

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:30.090
♪ ...am to offer... ♪

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:36.260
Granny Elder!

00:09:37.190 --> 00:09:40.260
What is it, Granny Elder?

00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:42.130
Wear yours.

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:45.100
Ah!

00:09:46.310 --> 00:09:50.110
♪ If I am to offer... ♪

00:09:48.690 --> 00:09:50.110
The temple's song...?

00:09:50.110 --> 00:09:55.990
♪ ...a wish to the day star... ♪

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:57.400
Take off your visor!

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:09.580
There, there. Don't cry. Don't cry.

00:10:12.920 --> 00:10:23.280
♪ The day star... good night... ♪

00:10:23.280 --> 00:10:32.400
♪ Please have a good night's sleep. ♪

00:10:33.540 --> 00:10:36.440
♪ If I am to offer... ♪

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:42.910
One of the stars of Fractale disappeared 
in the dawn sky five days ago.

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:45.450
And another one did yesterday.

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:50.680
This world's second hand keeps ticking.

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:54.800
As for those who act as part of 
the Lost Millennium movement,

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:58.920
I have forgiven their poor and sad souls

00:10:58.920 --> 00:11:01.430
and tolerated their actions up until now.

00:11:02.430 --> 00:11:07.630
However, they committed the grave sin of 
stealing this world's beloved maidens.

00:11:08.180 --> 00:11:12.020
And more importantly, this world 
does not have much time left.

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:17.530
How we must respond to these actions is...

00:11:18.030 --> 00:11:19.650
suppression.

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:25.160
Give their souls eternal peace...

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:27.450
at their rightful place beside Fractale.

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:37.130
Granny Elder, this one is too big for me.

00:11:37.130 --> 00:11:38.590
Come here.

00:11:40.010 --> 00:11:42.930
We're already on their wanted list.

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:45.220
They're depending solely on Fractale.

00:11:45.220 --> 00:11:47.170
It'd be hard for them to find this place

00:11:47.170 --> 00:11:50.330
since we're intercepting 
all the radio waves, but...

00:11:50.330 --> 00:11:54.020
We brought some food and 
blankets for the time being.

00:11:54.420 --> 00:11:55.810
Oh, thanks!

00:11:55.810 --> 00:11:57.080
Bring them inside.

00:11:58.280 --> 00:12:00.440
Are you guys really leaving?

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:04.740
Yeah, the only ones the temple is 
after are us, the Granites Family.

00:12:05.060 --> 00:12:07.410
Takamy, Daidara, Gowan,

00:12:07.870 --> 00:12:10.160
Gramps Elder, Granny Elder, Enri,

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:14.160
Urumuto, Chikage, Tsunami, and Sanko.

00:12:16.840 --> 00:12:19.090
The temple is really cruel.

00:12:19.670 --> 00:12:22.670
Sanko is still so small. Peekaboo!

00:12:22.670 --> 00:12:25.580
I'm okay. I'm strong!

00:12:25.580 --> 00:12:27.850
I can even eat fish bones.

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:30.060
As long as we're not here,

00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:32.850
they probably won't harm this village.

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:34.850
But what about you guys?

00:12:34.850 --> 00:12:36.380
Don't worry.

00:12:36.380 --> 00:12:41.030
The souls of those who live in the 
Fractale System are long dead.

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:43.200
We have lives that they are after,

00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:46.530
which is the proof that our 
souls are pulsing within us.

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:47.700
But...

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:49.280
Hey, you agree, right?

00:12:52.610 --> 00:12:54.410
That's right. Cry more!

00:12:55.280 --> 00:12:58.290
Our future is crying loud!

00:12:58.290 --> 00:13:01.250
Crying so strongly that its face turns red!

00:13:01.900 --> 00:13:03.010
Sunda...

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:07.260
To keep crying... To keep making our 
voices heard in this damn world!

00:13:08.080 --> 00:13:10.300
That's the Lost Millennium...

00:13:10.300 --> 00:13:13.060
and that's us, the Granites Family.

00:13:16.940 --> 00:13:19.440
We're gonna leave before the sun rises!

00:13:20.070 --> 00:13:22.440
We've got no time to dilly-dally.

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:25.110
Clain?

00:13:25.110 --> 00:13:26.950
Let's go now while we can, Nessa.

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:30.370
It'll be a long journey, though.

00:13:30.370 --> 00:13:31.750
Are we running away?

00:13:32.930 --> 00:13:36.750
Yeah, I don't wanna ask the temple for help.

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:39.290
And all these guys... I don't get them, so...

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:42.550
<i>What should I do about Phryne?</i>

00:13:46.920 --> 00:13:50.420
Clain! You're thinking 
about Phryne, aren't you?!

00:13:50.420 --> 00:13:52.610
Huh...? Well...

00:13:52.610 --> 00:13:55.640
Don't think about Phryne!

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:58.020
Think only about Nessa!

00:13:58.020 --> 00:14:02.980
Nessa, Nessa, Nessa, Nessa!

00:13:59.860 --> 00:14:02.380
O-Okay! Okay!

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:31.050
All women and children 
should hide in rocky areas!

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:33.720
Everyone! Take up positions!

00:14:34.810 --> 00:14:39.940
Our first priority is to take the world's 
beloved maidens under our protection.

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:45.320
Do not shed the blood of any villagers 
except the Granites Family...

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:47.650
except only when it can't be helped...

00:14:47.650 --> 00:14:49.490
don't go overboard... keep it reasonable.

00:14:50.070 --> 00:14:52.450
This is not a massacre.

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:54.490
This is to aid those who 
struggle in the darkness

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:57.020
bereft of Fractale's blessing, 
so it's definitely not...

00:14:57.020 --> 00:15:00.210
Well done! You've already 
found this place, huh?

00:15:00.870 --> 00:15:03.380
We already knew about this place.

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:07.170
And yet, the Archpriestess still forgave you.

00:15:07.170 --> 00:15:09.670
To think that you don't 
appreciate her consideration...

00:15:09.670 --> 00:15:11.180
That's very nice of her.

00:15:15.340 --> 00:15:17.310
Suppress them immediately!

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:21.640
Hmph!

00:15:21.640 --> 00:15:22.680
Ow!

00:15:29.860 --> 00:15:31.290
Good job, Enri!

00:15:31.290 --> 00:15:33.370
Do the east side, next. Go!

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:39.410
What're you doing, Granny? Hurry!

00:15:39.830 --> 00:15:42.080
B-But, Nessa is...

00:15:42.080 --> 00:15:44.080
That's a doppel.

00:15:46.380 --> 00:15:48.000
Wh-What should I do?!

00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:50.670
Whoa! The flickering lights are pretty!

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:52.010
Geez, Nessa!

00:15:55.100 --> 00:15:58.140
Phryne! What's she doing?!

00:15:58.140 --> 00:16:00.980
Really, she's such a tomboy, 
though she doesn't look the part!

00:16:01.360 --> 00:16:03.310
Don't go!

00:16:03.780 --> 00:16:04.650
Huh?

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:06.770
Don't go to Phryne!

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:10.150
Don't say such a selfish 
thing at a time like this!

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:12.090
We have to rescue her, right?!

00:16:14.450 --> 00:16:15.780
But...

00:16:16.670 --> 00:16:17.620
I'm going, okay?

00:16:21.810 --> 00:16:23.500
Come on, Nessa.

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:25.820
Nessa!

00:16:28.920 --> 00:16:29.840
I'm going.

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:33.300
Phryne!

00:16:39.560 --> 00:16:40.780
Where's that girl?

00:16:40.780 --> 00:16:42.350
Ah... Um...

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:45.480
She hates me, doesn't she?

00:16:45.840 --> 00:16:48.940
W-Well... that's...

00:16:49.770 --> 00:16:53.650
And she came to like you very 
much before you knew it.

00:16:53.650 --> 00:16:54.490
What?!

00:16:54.840 --> 00:16:59.880
I never expected there was someone 
who could open that data.

00:16:59.880 --> 00:17:00.790
You are...

00:17:02.950 --> 00:17:03.710
Where're you going?!

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:06.710
I cannot allow myself to 
be caught by the temple!

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:11.020
I probably won't see you 
again... and that girl as well!

00:17:23.640 --> 00:17:25.160
You're not fair!

00:17:25.160 --> 00:17:26.520
You don't tell me anything!

00:17:27.150 --> 00:17:29.230
The other day, too! You disappeared 
without saying anything!

00:17:29.230 --> 00:17:30.760
If I didn't notice,

00:17:30.760 --> 00:17:33.070
you were going to do the same 
this time, weren't you?!

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:40.030
What I do should be none of your business!

00:17:40.030 --> 00:17:42.660
I want to know about you.

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:43.830
What?

00:17:43.830 --> 00:17:46.400
That's why I checked Nessa's data.

00:17:46.400 --> 00:17:47.960
And yet, you are...

00:17:48.710 --> 00:17:52.630
Phryne... Miss Phryne... There you are!

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:54.340
The temple...

00:17:58.680 --> 00:18:00.260
Clain! Do you...

00:18:01.010 --> 00:18:03.520
Huh? What'd you say? I can't hear you well!

00:18:03.520 --> 00:18:06.380
Do you like me?!

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:10.110
Huh?!

00:18:11.710 --> 00:18:14.280
That girl said that she likes liking, right?

00:18:14.980 --> 00:18:17.950
But I dislike liking!

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:18.530
What?

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:20.740
W-We're gonna crash!

00:18:26.960 --> 00:18:30.210
There you are, Phryne, you bad girl!

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:34.500
The innocent blood that's about 
to be shed in this village...

00:18:34.500 --> 00:18:37.720
This is the result you brought 
about with your selfish soul.

00:18:39.590 --> 00:18:42.220
Of course, you know that, don't you?

00:18:42.600 --> 00:18:44.600
Right, Miss Phryne?

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:46.980
Wh-Who's this man?

00:18:46.980 --> 00:18:50.130
On top of that, you're not only 
selfish, but a wimp as well, huh?

00:18:50.670 --> 00:18:53.320
To think that you took that girl with you...

00:18:53.730 --> 00:18:56.080
Were you that lonely being by yourself?

00:18:57.660 --> 00:19:00.360
Well then, Miss Phryne, here's 
a three-choice question.

00:19:00.360 --> 00:19:02.640
This world doesn't have much time left,

00:19:02.640 --> 00:19:05.160
so answer it within 10 seconds.

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:06.830
Question 1!

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:11.790
What kind of actions will this 
world's beloved maidens take now?

00:19:11.790 --> 00:19:13.500
Huh? What's that?

00:19:13.500 --> 00:19:16.840
A: Go back to the temple 
happily, holding hands.

00:19:16.840 --> 00:19:19.880
B: Go back to the temple while bickering.

00:19:19.880 --> 00:19:23.680
C: Go back to the temple for the 
time being since they're hungry.

00:19:23.680 --> 00:19:25.380
Now, which one?

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:26.970
Huh?

00:19:29.180 --> 00:19:30.460
What're you doing?!

00:19:30.460 --> 00:19:32.730
A fourth choice isn't allowed, Miss Phryne!

00:19:33.010 --> 00:19:37.150
H-Hey! Wait! Phryne! Phryne!

00:19:41.150 --> 00:19:46.080
<i>This sky... is the sky 
Phryne flew on one day.</i>

00:19:46.740 --> 00:19:48.010
Bad girl, Phryne!

00:19:48.010 --> 00:19:50.080
Are you going to commit another evil deed?!

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:04.220
Phryne! Don't let her get away! 
Follow them! Follow them!

00:20:04.220 --> 00:20:06.230
Follow them within three seconds!

00:20:11.380 --> 00:20:14.690
Hey! It's no use running away!

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:17.440
You smell no matter how far you go!

00:20:17.440 --> 00:20:20.900
I can smell you anywhere you go, Miss Phryne!

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:37.320
Humph! So you came, too?

00:20:37.320 --> 00:20:38.700
You said this and that about us,

00:20:38.700 --> 00:20:41.090
but you must like us quite a bit.

00:20:41.390 --> 00:20:42.560
That's not true!

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:45.430
Nessa, aren't you here?

00:20:45.430 --> 00:20:47.740
What? Nessa is here?

00:20:47.740 --> 00:20:49.480
She's a doppel,

00:20:49.480 --> 00:20:51.850
so she can appear anywhere she wants.

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:54.350
She even followed me to the bathroom.

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:57.400
Nessa, I'm sorry to leave you earlier.

00:20:57.400 --> 00:20:59.400
Come out, Nessa.

00:20:59.900 --> 00:21:01.940
I wonder if she's still sulking.

00:21:01.940 --> 00:21:03.900
Nessa isn't here?

00:21:03.900 --> 00:21:08.070
Well, I think she'll come 
around soon and appear.

00:21:08.070 --> 00:21:09.830
As long as I'm here...

00:21:11.280 --> 00:21:12.700
you can't say that for sure.

00:21:12.700 --> 00:21:13.470
Huh?

00:21:17.330 --> 00:21:18.710
Clain...

00:21:19.920 --> 00:21:21.250
you dummy...
